{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Degeons Project</strong> is an immersive first and third persons puzzle game that places you in a vast, abandoned scientific complex owned by the mysterious Degeons Laboratory's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A MYSTERY SHROUDED IN SECRECY</strong><br>Once a bustling state-of-the-art research center, the facility now lies empty, shrouded in oppressive silence. It was hastily abandoned after a catastrophic incident, the cause and consequences of which remain hidden. Your task is not only to survive but to get to the bottom of what happened here. Study logs, reconstruct events, and uncover the dark secrets the corporation tried to bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CHALLENGE FOR THE MIND</strong><br>Forget conventional mechanics. You will face unique and ingenious puzzles that defy standard logic and perception. Each solved puzzle is a step closer to the truth and a key to new areas of the massive complex, from sterile labs to secret underground facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN UNSEEN THREAT</strong><br>You are not alone. From the very beginning, you are closely watched by the enigmatic figure of the Man in the Crow Suit. Who is he? A custodian? A victim? Or the cause of the catastrophe? His silent presence creates an atmosphere of paranoia and tension, making you wonder: is he part of the puzzle, or the force that will prevent you from finding the answer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Gameplay:</strong> Solve unique puzzles based on fresh, unusual mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story:</strong> Immerse yourself in a sci-fi mystery filled with atmosphere and suspense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World:</strong> Explore a sprawling, detailed abandoned complex bearing traces of its past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Antagonist:</strong> Encounter the enigmatic Man in the Crow Suit, whose motives and goals you must uncover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your intellect and courage to reveal the truth hidden deep within the <strong>Degeons Project</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Evrika!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/52dcffaa4eb9be77365570fceb8c582803b1c889.jpg"},{"name":"Portal Gun?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/842094bbdab4d7d48945e1c32607e44751f0ae46.jpg"},{"name":"The Raven Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/7c4560bf1db4b5df165244e52d416a6b5b1ab060.jpg"},{"name":"Experiment 7278","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/562a1412b79cf221165435441c6c3b2488301af6.jpg"},{"name":"Where is the logic?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/f98dce0903ad07465e25b073ea1695dd6d2d0449.jpg"},{"name":"Mixing?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/b17834f83b0f25de4a01f4267f5ae3f506ae3eeb.jpg"},{"name":"Project Mayhem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/7c4560bf1db4b5df165244e52d416a6b5b1ab060.jpg"},{"name":"Charlie Clerk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/2721c9b284bea7dc50062d05d5638ac1c9ff79a5.jpg"},{"name":"The finale?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/acf7a56c7a42d94d7419c869288010ff667e4b7e.jpg"},{"name":"Project Kili","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4077780/a79e601b2811e1a61a4f6e2b8d32964578de3bf6.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077780?t=1772805325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077780?t=1772805325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077780/a423129c8395c1216ee65e478253807f73e26373/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772805325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077780/a423129c8395c1216ee65e478253807f73e26373/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772805325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4077950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Degeons Project</strong> is an immersive first and third persons puzzle game that places you in a vast, abandoned scientific complex owned by the mysterious Degeons Laboratory's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A MYSTERY SHROUDED IN SECRECY</strong><br>Once a bustling state-of-the-art research center, the facility now lies empty, shrouded in oppressive silence. It was hastily abandoned after a catastrophic incident, the cause and consequences of which remain hidden. Your task is not only to survive but to get to the bottom of what happened here. Study logs, reconstruct events, and uncover the dark secrets the corporation tried to bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CHALLENGE FOR THE MIND</strong><br>Forget conventional mechanics. You will face unique and ingenious puzzles that defy standard logic and perception. Each solved puzzle is a step closer to the truth and a key to new areas of the massive complex, from sterile labs to secret underground facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN UNSEEN THREAT</strong><br>You are not alone. From the very beginning, you are closely watched by the enigmatic figure of the Man in the Crow Suit. Who is he? A custodian? A victim? Or the cause of the catastrophe? His silent presence creates an atmosphere of paranoia and tension, making you wonder: is he part of the puzzle, or the force that will prevent you from finding the answer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Gameplay:</strong> Solve unique puzzles based on fresh, unusual mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story:</strong> Immerse yourself in a sci-fi mystery filled with atmosphere and suspense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World:</strong> Explore a sprawling, detailed abandoned complex bearing traces of its past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Antagonist:</strong> Encounter the enigmatic Man in the Crow Suit, whose motives and goals you must uncover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your intellect and courage to reveal the truth hidden deep within the <strong>Degeons Project</strong>.</p>","developers":["Mystery Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077780/c150b038673e66c1da2a00c4c45fffd8997829b8/header.jpg?t=1772805325","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4077780/2129820206/006d9c84be23b58f96a552d4779e8a09eae45f4d/1772715701/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772717014","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4077780/2129820206/006d9c84be23b58f96a552d4779e8a09eae45f4d/1772715701/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772717014","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4077780/2129820206/006d9c84be23b58f96a552d4779e8a09eae45f4d/1772715701/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772717014","id":257298257,"name":"Degeons Project - Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati